title: IntroCall2Part1
---
Samantha: Me and the boys are ready near the bank, how 'bout you?
Lucas: Same here.
Samantha: Good, we're going in. Engine is gonna plug you into the mainframe.
Samantha: And, you're good to go. The doors in the back are remotely controlled. You can access them through the security chief's computer.
Lucas: Give me a sec.
===

title: IntroCall2Part2
---
Lucas: Found it! It's password-protected.
Samantha: That was expectable, you still know how to do it right? You mentioned finding the code, then you have to decompress it, right? And decode, I guess?
Lucas: You're kinda right actually, also I have my guidebook ready just in case.
Samantha: Good, go get it for us.
===

title: IntroCall2Part3
---
Lucas: Okay, I got the password. All I need is to type it in and open the damn doors.
Samantha: I knew you had it!
===

title: IntroCall2Part4
---
Lucas: Doors should be open by now.
Samantha: Yes indeed. *Laughing* All the money, just for us.
Lucas: Ey! Don't forget about that 25% for the client.
Samantha: Yeah Mr Dawdler and Fun-killer, I remember!
===

title: IntroCall2Part5
---
Unknown: Get down on the ground! Now!
Samantha: Lucas, run!
===
